# Instagram Media Downloader Configuration

# 1. Secret key used for signing opaque tokens (required in production)
TOKEN_SECRET=ig-media-downloader-super-secret-key-32chars!

# 2. (Recommended) Instagram Session Cookie:
# Setting your sessionid allows resolving any public post, reel, or carousel directly from Instagram GraphQL without IP rate blocks.
# To get your sessionid: Open Instagram in Chrome -> DevTools (F12) -> Application -> Cookies -> instagram.com -> copy 'sessionid'
# INSTAGRAM_SESSION_ID=your_instagram_session_id_here

# 3. (Alternative) RapidAPI Key for managed scraping:
# If you prefer using a managed scraper service like RapidAPI Instagram Downloader:
# RAPIDAPI_KEY=your_rapidapi_key_here
# RAPIDAPI_HOST=instagram-downloader-download-instagram-videos-stories1.p.rapidapi.com
